WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.918
Hisone's on a date?

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:04.838
What a predicament.

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:08.717
Mr. Ikushima, are you interested...

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.011
in Amakasu?

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:16.391
Feelings of love will cause over-secretion
of hormones in her body

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:19.227
and distort her suit size!

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.649
Masotan! I'm home!

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:32.449
I brought you a souvenir.

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:36.745
I'm sorry, but secondhand flip phones
are surprisingly expensive.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.956
With my salary, I could only
afford to buy five.

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:45.837
These are tokens
of my appreciation for you, Masotan.

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:49.090
Because of you, I've made friends.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:50.842
Lots of things have happened,

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.094
so I'm enjoying every day.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.472
Thank you, Masotan.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.149
T-They noticed?

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:09.277
I'm sorry, Masotan! I'll buy more
next time, but share now--

00:01:09.986 --> 00:01:11.780
A... Amakasu?

00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:14.282
Futomomo!

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:17.285
-Calm down!
-Go home, Norma!

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:20.872
Even Akemi is getting riled up.

00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:23.124
Are flip phones that delicious?

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:24.042
Oh!

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:26.836
What's your favorite confection?

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.630
Uh... Kamome or Tamago!

00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:32.050
-What about you, Hitomin?
-Hagi or Tsuki!

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:33.676
Yes!

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.141
One, two, three.

00:01:40.725 --> 00:01:43.311
You've done excellent work.

00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:47.190
I look forward to working with you again.

00:01:47.315 --> 00:01:49.526
Excuse me! Who are you?

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:54.197
Whatever.

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:00.912
I've been tricked!

